data/raw/brenda/*.tar.gz
data/raw/cazy/
data/raw/pdb/
data/raw/interpro/
data/raw/alphafold/
data/raw/uniprot/
data/raw/mcsa/
data/raw/structures/
# NOTE: data/raw/chebi/ and data/raw/chemistry/ ARE committed - they are the
# compound snapshot the simulator's physics depends on, and they are small.
# Everything else above is re-fetchable; those two are load-bearing.

